{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777282133922","title":"AI adoption kadang lahir dari constraint ekonomi, bukan teknologi keren","desc":"Dalam cerita ini AI muncul karena runway pendek, payment terms buruk, dan manual support yang tidak sustainable.","updated":1777349975837,"created":1777282142773,"tags":["zettel","ai","economics","the-developers-guide-to-ai","part-i"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"d03b13c93841f5a50da3eb88cc9adae4","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.economics","alias":"economics","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.economics"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.part-i","alias":"part-i","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.part-i"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1178},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1226},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282133922","id":"zettel.1777282133922","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1229},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1274},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":16,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-core":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini core","value":"kenapa-ini-core","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":35,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"ai-adoption-kadang-lahir-dari-constraint-ekonomi-bukan-teknologi-keren\">AI adoption kadang lahir dari constraint ekonomi, bukan teknologi keren<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ai-adoption-kadang-lahir-dari-constraint-ekonomi-bukan-teknologi-keren\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote “The math was brutal” adalah bahwa adopsi AI dalam cerita ini muncul karena constraint ekonomi, bukan karena mereka pengen main teknologi baru. Mereka terkena pressure: gak bisa nambah headcount, runway pendek, payment terms jelek, dan support manual tidak sustainable. Jadi AI masuk sebagai leverage ekonomi.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The math was brutal.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-core\">Kenapa ini core<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-core\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia mengubah narasi dari \"AI itu keren\" menjadi \"AI itu perlu\". Di titik ini gue melihat bahwa motivasi utama tim bukan eksperimen inovasi, tapi survival finansial dan operasional.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>AI dipakai untuk menekan biaya tenaga kerja dan menjaga runway, bukan sekadar untuk meningkatkan fitur.</li>\n<li>Cerita ini menempatkan adopsi AI sebagai keputusan ekonomi terlebih dahulu, baru sebagai keputusan teknis.</li>\n<li>Dengan demikian, use case AI yang dibahas di buku paling masuk akal ketika dilihat sebagai cara mengatasi bottleneck bisnis, bukan sebagai gadget baru.</li>\n<li>Ini juga menjelaskan kenapa tim memilih solusi yang cepat dan reuse-first: mereka tidak punya luxury untuk mengejar riset atau eksperimen panjang.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">economics (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nT